<title>Anthropic 内部研究显示初级技术岗位占比下降，AI Agent 工时达员工六倍 / Anthropic has nearly stopped hiring junior staff because AI agents now work six times as many hours</title>
<link>https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-has-nearly-stopped-hiring-junior-staff-because-ai-agents-now-work-six-times-as-many-hours</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-has-nearly-stopped-hiring-junior-staff-because-ai-agents-now-work-six-times-as-many-hours</guid>
<description>Anthropic 发布内部研究称，技术部门初级岗位占比从 2025 年初的 21% 降至 14%，新招初级占比从 27% 降至 9%，空缺初级职位降至 6%，非技术部门基本稳定。（The Decoder：AI News（RSS））</description>
<category>行业动态</category>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:22:26 +0000</pubDate>
</item>
